; A check or assert beneath a tag directive that has no expression is
; reported as missing its argument, as the other block directives
; report theirs (issue #3260).  The reader used to build the
; expression from a null pointer, which crashed it.

tag Invoice
    check

tag Order
    assert

test bal -> 2
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 7:
Error: Tag directive 'check' requires an argument
While parsing file "$FILE", line 10:
Error: Tag directive 'assert' requires an argument
end test
